    "cards": "The collection initializer scans exactly950 CardDef records at52-byte stride. Independent next SpriteFrameResourceDef metadata begins immediately after those records in every region. All24 non-pointer bytes per card agree across US/JP/EU. Seven actual pointer fields retain each native regional value; localized name records and text literals reuse their existing canonical owners. Native resource targets are exact pointer-field bindings, not interpolation or cross-language glyph guesses.",
    "backs": "Two physically distinct groups each contain five complete24-byte CardBack records before the four independent Shift-JIS marker strings. The first group is indexed by the actual CardDef category byte and explicit category4 calls. The second group contains five identical records; only runtime index0 is established from the current950 card identifiers. Its full native record run is preserved without claiming runtime reachability for the trailing four records. Previously opaque08/14 fields are actual ROM resource pointers in every record and region."
